# Runtime logs
#
# 2026-08-03: narrowed from `logs/` to `logs/*.log`. The blanket directory rule
# was hiding real content: three Python modules (CodetteSystemBridge,
# ForgeEngineRCXI, PersistentCocoonStore, PropagationMetrics,
# SelfTuningQuantumOptimizer), dated .txt notes, and logs/README.md — none of
# which existed anywhere else in the repository, and none of which `git status`
# would ever show. Because `logs/` excluded the directory itself, no child
# .gitignore could re-include them. Actual .log files are still ignored.
logs/*.log
*.log

